### Frontend build/dist ###
# NOTE: a `.gitignore` pattern containing a slash (other than a trailing one)
# is anchored to this file's directory, so `admin-panel/node_modules/` below
# only matched the top-level `admin-panel/` — not `admin/admin-panel/`, which
# is why 9k dependency files got staged. The `**/` prefix matches at any depth.
**/admin-panel/dist/
**/admin-panel/node_modules/
# Belt and braces: never track dependencies wherever they appear.
**/node_modules/


